BT /F1 12 Tf 0.605 Tw 72 562.00 Td (When rain falls on a roof, a driveway or a compacted lawn, very little of it soaks in. It runs off,) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1.381 Tw 72 545.00 Td (gathering speed and dirt, and is carried through gutters and drains to the nearest stream. On a) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1.691 Tw 72 528.00 Td (single lot the volume seems small. Across a neighbourhood it adds up to sudden floods after) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.000 Tw 72 511.00 Td (every storm and streams that run nearly dry between them.) Tj ET
0.122 0.165 0.141 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.987 Tw 72 486.00 Td (A rain garden reverses that pattern on a small scale. It is a shallow planted basin placed where) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.258 Tw 72 469.00 Td (runoff naturally collects, built so that water pools for a few hours and then sinks into the ground.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.377 Tw 72 452.00 Td (The soil filters out sediment and many pollutants, the plants take up nutrients, and the water that) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.000 Tw 72 435.00 Td (remains recharges the ground slowly instead of rushing away.) Tj ET
0.122 0.165 0.141 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 1.300 Tw 72 410.00 Td (None of this needs special equipment. A typical home rain garden can be dug by hand over a) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1.622 Tw 72 393.00 Td (weekend, planted with hardy native species and left largely alone. This primer walks through) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.427 Tw 72 376.00 Td (how one works, how to size it for your roof and soil, and how to keep it healthy once it is in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.000 Tw 72 359.00 Td (ground.) Tj ET
0.122 0.165 0.141 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.529 Tw 72 334.00 Td (The most important idea is that a rain garden is not a pond. It should hold standing water for no) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.067 Tw 72 317.00 Td (more than a day after a heavy storm. If it stays wet longer than that, the basin is too deep, the soil) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.476 Tw 72 300.00 Td (drains too slowly or too much water is being sent to it. Each of those problems has a simple fix,) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.000 Tw 72 283.00 Td (covered in the sections that follow.) Tj ET
