0.122 0.165 0.141 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 1.073 Tw 72 686.00 Td (Choose plants that tolerate both wet feet and dry spells, because a rain garden swings between) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.960 Tw 72 669.00 Td (the two. Deep rooted native grasses, sedges and flowering perennials are the backbone of most) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 2.671 Tw 72 652.00 Td (designs. Place the species that handle standing water best on the basin floor and the more) Tj ET
