0.122 0.165 0.141 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 1.379 Tw 72 610.00 Td (Plant densely, roughly one plant for every square foot, so that the canopy closes over the soil) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.076 Tw 72 593.00 Td (within two seasons and crowds out weeds. Water new plantings weekly during their first summer) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.000 Tw 72 576.00 Td (unless rain does the job for you.) Tj ET
0.122 0.165 0.141 rg
